sentences.text:
Although I find force in the submission of learned counsel for the respondent that statement of accounts does not show the current balance of `26,19,417.26p, but it shows the credit entries of amounts of `1,00,000/- on 27.1.2007;
`23,000/- on 9.2.2007; and, `1,60,000/-, `45,000/-, `68,500/- and `24,500/- on 27.4.2007,
during the period when the respondent is stated to have been earning only `7,500/-, per month.
